    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love Hotel Manager is a game where you own your own Love hotel! Manage and customize unique and whacky rooms while dealing with strange customers and their needs. Slowly expand your hotel to become a thriving business. <br> <br><strong>CUSTOMIZE ROOMS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love hotels are notorious for their unique rooms and themes. Have fun with strange novelty rooms or making more hip and stylish ones. Let your creativity run wild! <br> <br><strong>CUSTOMER NEEDS</strong> <br>Your rooms have different stats based on your furniture. Customers will have personal preferences as well as special customers and other quirky characters with wants of their own. <br> <br><strong>EXPAND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your hotel and add more rooms and maximize your profitability to have the ultimate love hotel business!\u00a0 </p>",
